{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-22","kind":"proposition","title":"四直线为断比例则两比例线上各任作自相似之直线形亦为断比例两比例线上各任作自…","englishTitle":"If four straight lines be proportional, the rectilineal figures similar and similarly described upon them will also be proportional; and, if the rectilineal figures similar and similarly described upon them be proportional, the straight lines will themselves also be proportional.","book":6,"number":22,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.22","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.22/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":22,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","contentId":"euclid-6-22","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d42c7974b39af09c8427d055b09196053ff9b63de9282e3cc7a9be920cf4e423","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-22.statement","euclid-6-22.construction.1","euclid-6-22.construction.2","euclid-6-22.proof.1","euclid-6-22.proof.2","euclid-6-22.proof.3","euclid-6-22.proof.4","euclid-6-22.proof.5","euclid-6-22.proof.6","euclid-6-22.proof.7","euclid-6-22.proof.8","euclid-6-22.proof.9","euclid-6-22.conclusion","euclid-6-22.historical.1","euclid-6-22.historical.2","euclid-6-22.historical.3","euclid-6-22.historical.4","euclid-6-22.historical.5","euclid-6-22.historical.6","euclid-6-22.historical.7","euclid-6-22.historical.8","euclid-6-22.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-22.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8fa0409ff77e498e1f734dca326b0c9e54fd739064ddc6cf02329e5fd494119b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If four straight lines be proportional, the rectilineal figures similar and similarly described upon them will also be proportional; and, if the rectilineal figures similar and similarly described upon them be proportional, the straight lines will themselves also be proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四条直线为成比例,则其上所描述的相似直线数字也将是成比例;如果其上所描述的直线数字相似和类似直线数字为成比例,则直线本身也将是成比例。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"四直线为断比例则两比例线上各任作自相似之直线形亦为断比例两比例线上各任作自相似之直线形为断比例则四直线为断比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四条线是分比例的，那么在两条成比例的线上任何自相似的线形也是分比例的，因此四条线成比例地分配。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"391a76bc97a63c18653f3467d1ded7a19499638477ce9cb6aa1d2aa13ed24e68","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the four straight lines AB, CD, EF, GH be proportional, so that, as AB is to CD, so is EF to GH, and let there be described on AB, CD the similar and similarly situated rectilineal figures KAB, LCD, and on EF, GH the similar and similarly situated rectilineal figures MF, NH; I say that, as KAB is to LCD, so is MF to NH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让这4条直线AB、CD、EF、GH和成比例等值,AB和CD等值,AB和CD等值类似和类似直线数字KAB、LCD和EF等值,EF、EF、EF、GH等值类似和类似直线数字MF、NH;我说,KAB和LCD等值MF和NH等值；AB 与 CD 之比等于 EF 与 GH 之比；KAB 与 LCD 之比等于 MF 与 NH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d649b60a9830e7e9ade0db3dd76194633d2924bc6d98ea7455c70c874386d519","citations":["euclid-6-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let there be taken a third proportional O to AB, CD, and a third proportional P to EF, GH. [[VI. 11](/principles/euclid-6-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"第三个成比例 O至AB,CD,第三个成比例至EF,GH。（相关点与线段：P） [[VI. 11](/principles/euclid-6-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ff193309fbc9af3491251bb594a1f07f6805a8157d36757c1189eaad643f87d0","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, as AB is to CD, so is EF to GH, and, as CD is to O, so is GH to P, therefore, ex aequali, as AB is to O, so is EF to P. [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,AB对CD的比等于EF对GH的比,CD对O的比等于GH对P的比,因此,从平等的角度讲,AB对O的比等于EF对P的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 EF 与 GH 之比；CD 与 O 之比等于 GH 与 P 之比；AB 与 O 之比等于 EF 与 P 之比。 [[V. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa4a51943a45a2973e03ca2dc5aa5f5289f4d305480dc683ae1d05bb7b72c520","citations":["euclid-6-19","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AB is to O, so is KAB to LCD, [[VI. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-19)] and, as EF is to P, so is MF to NH; therefore also, as KAB is to LCD, so is MF to NH. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB对O的比等于KAB对LCD的比,EF对P的比等于MF对NH的比;因此,KAB对LCD的比等于MF对NH的比；AB 与 O 之比等于 KAB 与 LCD 之比；EF 与 P 之比等于 MF 与 NH 之比；KAB 与 LCD 之比等于 MF 与 NH 之比。 [[VI. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-19)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6814c1bf0ab3df3cbe1ce9400cf45dc36bc332bf9edcc57613649735b9e8a6c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let MF be to NH as KAB is to LCD; I say also that, as AB is to CD, so is EF to GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,MF比NH,KAB比LCD;我还要说,AB比CD等于EF比GH；AB 与 CD 之比等于 EF 与 GH 之比；MF 与 NH 之比等于 KAB 与 LCD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"66bc4fc4b29ef7f7be8fd68b836b0d28583696ed704f41ce4bff656ef7d41906","citations":["euclid-6-12","euclid-6-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if EF is not to GH as AB to CD, let EF be to QR as AB to CD, [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] and on QR let the rectilineal figure SR be described similar and similarly situated to either of the two MF, NH. [[VI. 18](/principles/euclid-6-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果EF不是GH,是AB至CD,EF是QR,AB至CD,QR则是SR,直线图与这两条MF、NH中任何一个相似,类似；EF 与 GH 之比不等于 AB 与 CD 之比；EF 与 QR 之比等于 AB 与 CD 之比。 [[VI. 12](/principles/euclid-6-12)] [[VI. 18](/principles/euclid-6-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b26d1daac3a19e27a65deba2b3e779101b2edc60e74ff743c2f579c8b344462","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as AB is to CD, so is EF to QR, and there have been described on AB, CD the similar and similarly situated figures KAB, LCD, and on EF, QR the similar and similarly situated figures MF, SR, therefore, as KAB is to LCD, so is MF to SR."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AB比CD等于EF比QR,CD比KAB,LCD比AB,AB比KAB,CD比KAB,LCD比EF,EF比MF比SR,QR比MF比SR；AB 与 CD 之比等于 EF 与 QR 之比；KAB 与 LCD 之比等于 MF 与 SR 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d5fe5df405f70f3d577806b3eb9ec4fc26c84a4352e7c16eab52d43701458dd1","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But also, by hypothesis, as KAB is to LCD, so is MF to NH; therefore also, as MF is to SR, so is MF to NH. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设KAB比LCD等于MF比NH,因此,MF比SR等于MF比NH；KAB 与 LCD 之比等于 MF 与 NH 之比；MF 与 SR 之比等于 MF 与 NH 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b2e157f56e8dbaaaf27abdddef7931c7c37096c965d1ff04e7375bc9263ffe5a","citations":["euclid-5-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore MF has the same ratio to each of the figures NH, SR; therefore NH is equal to SR. [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,MF与数字中的每一个数字的比相同,分别为NH、SR;因此,NH等于SR。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4b6818234ce387ae99fe61950993e08924e608668cbc770c307a48a5998493f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also similar and similarly situated to it; therefore GH is equal to QR."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也相似,处境类似;因此,GH等于QR。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7aea66f1eb42e6895e44237dda155d8c8eb82b2166e4b5f339e5e7090539bd3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, as AB is to CD, so is EF to QR, while QR is equal to GH, therefore, as AB is to CD, so is EF to GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB对CD的比等于EF对QR的比,QR对GH的比等于AB对CD的比等于EF对GH的比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 EF 与 QR 之比；AB 与 CD 之比等于 EF 与 GH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"177425e26df3aaf6418263c0abdf204866c00015c3be2324f0f405b67677f46a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"四直线为断比例则两比例线上各任作自相似之直线形亦为断比例两比例线上各任作自相似之直线形为断比例则四直线为断比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果四条线是分比例的，那么在两条成比例的线上任何自相似的线形也是分比例的，因此四条线成比例地分配。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4c75a719874e40ae1cec7bae3ee1e5454bd32c33e5e8b1a01cb136c64af7d4f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛四直线为断比例者甲乙与丙丁若戊己与庚辛也今于甲乙丙丁上各任作直线形自相似如甲乙壬丙丁癸于戊己庚辛上各任作直线形自相似如戊己丑子庚辛卯寅题言四形亦为断比例者谓甲乙壬与丙丁癸若戊丑与庚卯也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，解释如下：甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛，四条直线是分比例的。如果甲乙和丙丁对应于戊己和庚辛，则在甲乙丙丁上，任何线形自然相似。例如，在甲乙壬丙丁癸和戊己庚辛上，每条线都相似。例如，戊己丑子庚辛卯寅。命题解释：四个形状也是分比例的，参考甲乙壬和丙丁癸。如果戊丑和庚卯也是直线，则它们是相似的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3894cd8d14dd71b235cd839fd2df70feeda223bfc5969ad49d6d4360681a855c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试以甲乙丙丁两线求其连比例之末率线为辰〈本篇十一〉次以戊己庚辛两线求其连比例之末率线为己平之即甲乙与辰之比例若戊己与己也〈五卷廿二〉夫甲乙壬与丙丁癸两相似形之比例若甲乙线与辰线〈本篇十九及廿之系〉而戊丑与庚卯两相似形之比例若戊己线与己线则甲乙壬与丙丁癸之比例亦若戊丑与庚卯矣〈五卷十一〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：使用甲乙丙丁线找到其连接比的终端比例线。辰〈本篇十一〉 然后使用戊己庚辛线找到其连接比的终端比例线为己。使甲乙与辰的比例相等。如果戊己和己相似，〈五卷廿二〉和丙丁癸的比例相似。如果甲乙和辰形状相似，〈本篇十九及廿之系〉和庚卯相似。如果戊己和己相似，则甲乙壬与丙丁癸的比例与戊丑和庚卯相似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4d211ee78eab770d7542493fff6899eea6f538de5daf4d658df2044d941f0a4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：如前四形为断比例题言甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛四线亦为断比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：如果前四个形状是分段比例，说明甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛和四条线也是分段比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45022149a8827a9ca77dff5c4baa167314328ebe97e8c29c860204bd6bdeaeeb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试以甲乙丙丁戊己三线求其断比例之末率线为午未〈本篇十二〉次于午未上作直线形与戊丑相似而体势等为午未酉申〈本篇十八〉午酉与戊丑相似即与庚卯亦相似而甲乙与丙丁之比例既若戊己与午未依上论即甲乙壬与丙丁癸两形之比例若戊丑与午酉矣夫甲乙壬与丙丁癸之比例元若戊丑与庚卯则戊丑与午酉亦若戊丑与庚卯也〈五卷十一〉而午酉与庚卯等也〈五卷九〉午酉与庚卯既等又相似而体势等即两形必在等线之上而庚辛与午未必等〈见下方补论〉则戊己与午未之比例若戊己与庚辛也而戊己与午未元若甲乙与丙丁则甲乙与丙丁亦若戊己与庚辛也补论曰庚卯午酉两直线形相等相似而体势等即在等线之上者何也盖庚辛与午未若云不等者或言庚辛大于午未也则辛卯宜亦大于未酉矣〈五卷十四〉而庚卯形宜亦大于午酉形矣何先设两形等也言小仿此〈补论者前此未著而论中无他论可征故别作一论以足未备〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：先对线段甲乙、丙丁、戊己作第四比例项午未〈本篇十二〉，再在午未上作图形午未酉申，使它与图形戊丑相似并具有相同的对应方向〈本篇十八〉。因此午酉既与戊丑相似，也与庚卯相似。因为甲乙与丙丁之比等于戊己与午未之比，根据前面已证的结论，图形甲乙壬与丙丁癸的面积之比，等于图形戊丑与午酉的面积之比。另一方面，原来的假设给出图形甲乙壬与丙丁癸之比等于戊丑与庚卯之比，因此戊丑与午酉之比等于戊丑与庚卯之比〈五卷十一〉，从而午酉与庚卯的面积相等〈五卷九〉。这两个图形相似、对应方向相同且面积相等，所以对应边午未与庚辛相等。于是戊己与午未之比也等于戊己与庚辛之比；又因戊己与午未之比等于甲乙与丙丁之比，最终得到甲乙与丙丁之比等于戊己与庚辛之比。补充说明：如果两个相似且对应方向相同的图形面积相等，而对应边却一长一短，较长对应边所在图形的面积也会更大〈五卷十四〉，这与两图形面积相等矛盾；因此对应边必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ea96087bd0d8785f4e7cf310e67d91eeebf0612424510c0982c60277d5ddb63","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"又补论曰：甲乙丙丁戊己两直线形相等相似而体势等即相似边如甲乙与丁戊必等者何也盖云不等者或言甲乙大于丁戊也即令以甲乙丁戊两线求其连比例之末率线为庚〈本篇十一〉其甲乙与丁戊既若丁戊与庚而甲乙大于丁戊即丁戊宜大于庚即甲乙宜更大于庚矣然甲乙与庚之比例若甲乙丙形与丁戊己形〈本篇十九及廿之系〉甲乙既大于庚则甲乙丙宜大于丁戊己何先设两形等也是甲乙不能大于丁戊矣言小仿此"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"另一个补充证明如下：甲乙丙丁戊己，两条线形状相等且类似，紧张度相等，即类似边缘。例如，为什么甲乙和丁戊必然相等？因为它们不相等，有人说甲乙大于丁戊，这意味着终端比线是用甲乙丁戊和甲乙丁戊 庚〈本篇十一〉计算的。如果甲乙和丁戊是丁戊和庚，并且甲乙大于丁戊，那么丁戊应大于庚，这意味着甲乙应大于庚。然而，如果甲乙与庚的比大于庚 〈本篇十九及廿之系〉甲乙，那么甲乙丙应大于丁戊己。首先，如果两种形状已设置且甲乙不能大于丁戊，据说这是一个次要类比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.7","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":19,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ad6421bc779f6ab5dfa344eaaeb3ae57cd3f813606f5c608db100a3f7fe3aff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"増论曰：本题别有简论今先显四线之比例等而甲乙壬与丙丁癸两形之比例若戊丑与庚卯两形者盖甲乙与丙丁之比例若戊己与庚辛而甲乙壬与丙丁癸之比例为甲乙与丙丁再加之比例〈本篇十九〉戊丑与庚卯之比例亦为戊己与庚辛再加之比例是甲乙壬与丙丁癸若戊丑与庚卯也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"额外证明如下：此问题有一个单独的简要讨论。在这里，首先显示四条线的比例，甲乙壬和丙丁癸的比例相等。如果戊丑和庚卯是两种形式，则比例为甲乙和丙丁。如果戊己、庚辛和甲乙壬0是甲乙和丙丁癸，则比例甲乙和丙丁加上〈本篇十九〉戊丑 庚卯也为戊己和庚辛，并且比例加上甲乙壬和丙丁癸为甲乙壬和丙丁癸，而戊丑和庚卯也是比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.historical.8","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":20,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8834eeea000830e29d1ae403660a60db574e8d15ecd8b4c58cc277c1d5c277cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"次増论曰：今显四形之比例等而甲乙与丙丁两线之比例若戊己与庚辛两线者盖甲乙壬与丙丁癸之比例若戊丑与庚卯而甲乙壬与丙丁癸之比例为甲乙与丙丁再加之比例若戊丑与庚卯为戊己与庚辛再加之比例〈本篇十九〉则甲乙与丙丁之比例若戊己与庚辛矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"额外证明如下：现在，四种形状的比例相同，甲乙和丙丁的比例与戊己和庚辛成比例，与甲乙壬到丙丁癸成比例。如果戊丑和庚卯是庚卯，并且甲乙壬到丙丁癸的比例为甲乙到丙丁，那么如果戊丑和庚卯是戊己到庚辛的比例加上〈本篇十九〉，则甲乙到丙丁的比例为戊己到庚辛。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-22.source","contentId":"euclid-6-22","revisionId":"euclid-6-22@raw-d42c7974b39af09c","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27857ca160361fb83bd0f402e802eed54f9d687cbd121fcc306eded9591eb000","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.22/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.22\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-22:euclid-6-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-22","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-22.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.22","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.22/","sourceLabel":"VI. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-22:euclid-5-22:explicit","